		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C3E8D47479787F5"]
			description: ["The calutron picks fermium-257 out of the fermium, the transuranium facility plates it, and the spark plasma sinterer fuses it into an &6Fm-257 Target&r."]
			icon: "grindless:fm257_target"
